  <h2 id="current-boundaries">What you can use today</h2>
  <p>
    You need an AI app that supports MCP, a standard for connecting AI to tools. To approve
    requests, the app also needs to show MCP approval forms (called “form elicitation”). You do not
    need a database or cloud account.
  </p>
  <p>
    This version supports OpenAPI 3.0 JSON files with some limits. It does not yet support OAuth
    sign-in, GraphQL, connecting other MCP servers, or hosted team accounts. Check the{' '}
    <a href="/docs/config/">supported formats</a> before connecting your app.
  </p>
</Docs>
